 "differences": [
  "Group differences in the Adaptation Index that the paper reports as Bayesian posterior means (Feedback On group difference (0.23), End Adaptation group difference (0.17), Implicit Aftereffect group difference (0.10), group x time interaction (0.09)) were recomputed as differences of raw group means and came out 0.269, 0.179, 0.066, 0.138; they are not used as checks.",
  "The mean percentage of strides removed as outliers comes out 0.149 (stroke) and 0.907 (control) from the shared tables and from the deposit's own removed_strides.txt, against 0.14 and 0.92 in the paper (the maximum values, 0.39 and 2.32, do reproduce).",
  "Handedness, race and the other clinical-sheet fields are not released; sex comes from the clinical spreadsheet."
 ],
